      "value": "i feel like if would be a possibly feature to add on quest 3 but probably still be super laggy and low fps or low quality with how fast the assess speeds needs to; if they would write the cameras texture buffer / asset right to a socket and streamed it over adb (or a virtual camera??).\n\n(((tho its also pretty easy to use a second account even on a cruddier computer to stream you playing on a quest if you stay in one room... idk if you could easily track other players with it, it would seem like a weird feature to have, never played around with it too much)))",
